{"id":"50f0afd61c5e6fe6","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-jet.md","title":"Jet","display":"df-jet — Jet","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jet","aliases":["58-df-jet","Jet"],"display":"df-jet — Jet","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-taylor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jet</span><span>Jet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jet — Jet"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e72ce9e8de4a5cad\" href=\"?note=e72ce9e8de4a5cad\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-taylor.md\">../batch01/58-df-taylor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: M \\to N\">\\(f: M \\to N\\)</span> (smooth map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:M\\to N\">\\(g:M\\to N\\)</span> (smooth map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\in M\">\\(p \\in M\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> (jet order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^k_{p,M,N}(f)\">\\(j^k_{p,M,N}(f)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-jet of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> with source and target recorded)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (smooth-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(g,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\bigl(D^if(p)=D^ig(p)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(g,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\bigl(D^if(p)=D^ig(p)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S(f,g,p,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S(f,g,p,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}class} \\vdash j^k_{p,M,N}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}class} \\vdash j^k_{p,M,N}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}spaces} \\vdash J_p^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\{j^k_{p,M,N}(f):f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\}\\land J^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{p\\in M}J_p^k(M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}spaces} \\vdash J_p^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\{j^k_{p,M,N}(f):f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\}\\land J^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{p\\in M}J_p^k(M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jet: equivalence class of maps with the same derivatives up to order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; both comprehensions are bounded by the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N^M\">\\(N^M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Jet bundle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^k(M,N) \\to M\">\\(J^k(M,N) \\to M\\)</span> with fiber <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_0^k(\\mathbb{R}^m, \\mathbb{R}^n)\">\\(J_0^k(\\mathbb{R}^m, \\mathbb{R}^n)\\)</span>; dimension formula</li>\n<li>Spray: 1-jet field generating geodesics; exponential map via flow\n-jet transversality: Thom; generic maps have regular values; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\">\\(A_k\\)</span> singularities</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Saunders, The Geometry of Jet Bundles</li>\n<li>Kolar, Michor and Slovak, Natural Operations in Differential Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-taylor.md","status":"resolved","id":"e72ce9e8de4a5cad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-taylor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (smooth-map predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f: M \\to N","display":false},{"tex":"g:M\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"p \\in M","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"j^k_{p,M,N}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(g,M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\forall i\\leq k\\;\\bigl(D^if(p)=D^ig(p)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{JetEquivalent}_S(f,g,p,k)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}class} \\vdash j^k_{p,M,N}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{JetEquivalentStructure}_S(f,g,p,k,M,N)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jet\\text{-}spaces} \\vdash J_p^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\{j^k_{p,M,N}(f):f\\in N^M\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\}\\land J^k(M,N)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{p\\in M}J_p^k(M,N)","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"N^M","display":false},{"tex":"J^k(M,N) \\to M","display":false},{"tex":"J_0^k(\\mathbb{R}^m, \\mathbb{R}^n)","display":false},{"tex":"A_k","display":false}],"bytes":2015,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6060c5d1003e78e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-717","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-jet.md|58-df-jet]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["d87c5d842ade903d","e72ce9e8de4a5cad","36d7463d215be751"]}